{"scope":"knowledge/storyboard","page":0,"pageSize":24,"total":143,"totalPages":6,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-022dcf779d5e","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"跨镜一致性锁","description":"识别锚点是写给创作者读的事实；执行端读不到它，只读得到每条提示词自己的正文。同一件毛衣第一镜 织的是蓝色、第二镜变成红色，通常不是资产写错了，而是**没有任何一条提示词把颜色带进去**：视觉 设定写了，关键帧写了一半，运动提示词以为参考帧已经交代过就把重复描述删掉了。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/continuity-lock.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0728f9d82aa0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"原著分析阶段契约","description":"本文件是本技能的自包含契约：预检、所有权、材料边界与规则表都在这里， 不需要读取其他技能的文件。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-novel-analyze/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-novel-analyze","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-079245051fa0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"私有卡片与 Coverage Matrix","description":"卡片只保存在维护者指定的隔离工作区。用随机内部 ID、内容 hash 或抽象 locator 追溯证据； 不要在卡片之外复制整段剧本。观察和解释分栏，未知保持未知。一个项目要先通读完整文本链再制卡， 不能把搜索命中当作完整上下文。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/cards-and-coverage.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-07c6fb890483","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"逐章提取","description":"一章提取一份 `chapters/ch-<N>-extract.md`，`<N>` 用索引里的 `sequence`（多卷书的原文 章号会重复，sequence 不会）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-novel-analyze/references/chapter-extraction.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-novel-analyze","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-084dae7da605","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"微短剧题材 × 钩子 × 因果反转手册（治「剧情太简单 / 反转空降」）","description":"> 剧情简单 = 没选对题材爽感 + 钩子弱 + **反转是空降的**。本手册给：题材/钩子**素材库** + > **因果反转生成法**（核心，治空降反转）+ 集末悬念 + 情绪钩子。 > 配套：人物/引擎见 `story-engine.md`；爽点/反派见 `satisfaction-and-villain.md`；落节拍见 `causal-beats.md`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/genre-hooks-handbook.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0945b7bd007b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"短剧类型指南","description":"1. **过度隐忍**：西方观众更倾向主角快速反击 2. **家长权威**：西方观众不接受无条件服从长辈 3. **道德绑架**：善良不能沦为软弱的借口 4. **大团圆执念**：开放式结局在海外接受度更高","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/genre-guide.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-09cdfb51dfcf","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"四幕短剧结构（单集剧本）","description":"> 竖屏微短剧单集 15–30s，节奏极快。用「四幕起承转合」把单集写成一个完整的小高潮单元， > 且**每集末必留钩子**接下一集。 > **四幕是「结构骨架」，`causal-beats.md` 是「填充血肉」**——四幕对应因果节拍的 > 目标(起)→阻碍(承)→转折(转)→钩子(合)，各幕之间必须用「因为/所以」串成因果链， > 别写成「然后…然后…」流水账。爽点密度按 `causal-beats.md`：每 15–30s 一个情绪事件。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/four-act-drama.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0ac5f86884d7","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"分镜完成前检查","description":"这份清单只检查 `分镜.md` 能直接证明的结构事实，把审查注意力留给真正需要读懂戏的判断。 检查发现问题就修正文档，不另建 coverage、QA 或校验结果文件。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/review-and-fixtures.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0b481e560233","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"去标识、合成与知识生命周期","description":"先用完整项目链解释一次机制如何工作，再寻找有意义的对照。候选描述问题、条件、可选动作、 预期的文本可观察效果和停止使用的信号。它不是对源项目的摘要，也不是“爆款公式”。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/synthesis-and-promotion.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0bf09a35f4db","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Lookdev 风格帧提示词","description":"Lookdev 风格帧把 `视觉设定.md` 中项目级视觉方向投影成可比较的通用图片提示词。它不选择画风， 不生成图片，也不从一张参考图推断整部作品的规则。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/lookdev-frame.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0c2cfd513b44","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"资产连续性与变化记录","description":"对相连镜头，逐字段比较前一镜已接受的结束状态与下一镜已接受的开始状态。 只有上游负责人已经记录变化，或负责人明确提出的修订仍在处理中，差异才有依据； 不得靠运动提示词悄悄“补过去”。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/continuity-delta.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0d3f1b9b234d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"题材卡索引","description":"这里只做**索引与召回规范**。每个题材的可执行内容拆在同目录的 `genre-cards/` 下，一次只读一张。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/genre-cards.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0d6aaf424881","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"道具与状态设计","description":"只有会被识别、操作、传递、读取、揭示或保持连续性的物体，才值得成为受管道具。 普通背景物可保留为 `set_dressing` occurrence；一旦角色拿起它打开秘密、它跨场转手， 就要能以稳定身份追踪。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/prop-and-state.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-0dff806cae40","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"改编价值快评","description":"一份 `triage.md`，回答**这本书值不值得花全量拆解的成本**。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-novel-analyze/references/adaptation-triage.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-novel-analyze","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1022f1374e7b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"生产视频提示词：边界、连续性与写法选择","description":"来自对剧本、分镜边界、参考帧与视频任务之间完整链路的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成 改写。本套件的运动说明格式见 [motion-recipe.md](motion-recipe.md)；本文档是 生产端语法的对照参考：写通用提示词时借用其成熟约定，但套件产物仍以该文档规定的 结构为准，且**不调用任何生成服务、不出现供应商与模型产品名**—— 模型相关规则一律写成\"按目标模型确认\"的条件规则。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/production-prompt-grammar.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-10f202611f6c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Storyboard, Keyframe, And Motion Rubric","description":"genuinely differ — in knowledge timing, audience alignment, performance space, strongest image, landing, losses, or production fit? pressure, camera rhythm, reaction landing, and sound movement carry **one** dramatic turn? merely to satisf…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-visual-motion.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1548a9030b73","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"内容合规检查清单","description":"以下正面价值在剧本中应有所体现（不强求每个都有，但整体价值观导向要正确）：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/compliance-checklist.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-197fd24f79f1","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"上传与发布","description":"来源：https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a0ed4301b7d0404ef4782f7 （2026-08-13 13:37）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/publish.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1a8bd93d8895","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"五份创作文档","description":"这是一份建议格式，不是 schema。优先让人一眼读懂；只有跨文档引用和投产定位需要稳定 ID。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/creator-documents.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1cd93b312904","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"多集整稿接入与断点续跑","description":"当创作者给的是一份已经写好的多集剧本、散稿或合订稿，并希望生成或补齐 `项目开发/episode-map.jsonl` 时使用本流程。它不是小说改编分析，也不是把整份文件塞进一次 提示词：**Agent 判断这份文件实际怎样分集、每集讲了什么；脚本只保存精确定位并防止重复劳动**。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/multi-episode-intake.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1f76d5744a08","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"剧本阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/剧本.md`：场景、动作、对白、画外音、声音事实、画面文字、连续性提示与转场。 它继承项目/分集决定，但不决定人物视觉身份、镜头构图、提示词或媒体生产。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-24860391a810","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"反派设计体系","description":"微短剧的反派不是\"坏人\"那么简单。反派的质量直接决定了爽点的质量——主角打脸一个路人甲，观众无感；打脸一个嚣张了十集的恶人，观众拍手叫好。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/villain-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2694978f9f0c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"结算","description":"来源：https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a0ed443124e9404bb0a1fa3 （2026-08-13 13:38）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/settle.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-27721e0bd833","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"钩子设计指南","description":"**定义**：在结尾制造未解之谜，激发好奇心。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/hook-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}}]}
